MealTrace / 食迹, 2026. Original app code: MIT (see LICENSE).

Bundled ARM64 vision runner: llama.cpp and GGML, MIT.
Pinned source: https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/tree/547208dca250ceb3e4c8615598d043f2b602a527
Includes a Qwen-only no-thinking prompt patch. Native provenance and SHA256:
app/src/main/assets/native-build.json and acceleration-build.json.
Rebuild: tools/prepare_native.py and tools/prepare_acceleration.py.
The optional Hexagon worker adds the MealTrace private stdio protocol in
tools/native/worker.inc. Generic CPU fallback remains a separate executable.
DSP skeleton: upstream GGML Hexagon code, built with Hexagon SDK 6.6.0.0 /
tools 19.0.07, V81 compatibility target. Qualcomm FastRPC drivers are provided
by the handset and are not redistributed in this repository or APK.
SDK/toolchain source and build provenance: docs/ANDROID-ACCELERATION.md.
Additional native dependencies include nlohmann/json, cpp-httplib, xxHash,
SHA-256 and rotate-bits; licenses are in licenses/ and bundled in APK assets.

Vision model: Qwen3.5-2B, Qwen team / Alibaba, Apache License 2.0.
https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3.5-2B
GGUF quantization: Unsloth, revision f6d5376be1edb4d416d56da11e5397a961aca8ae.
https://huggingface.co/unsloth/Qwen3.5-2B-GGUF
Weights are distributed separately. Pinned checksums: assets/models.json.
No claim is made that this general model measures food mass accurately.

Food candidate detection: Google ML Kit bundled image-labeling 17.0.9.
Terms and privacy: https://developers.google.com/ml-kit/terms
Image inputs and outputs are processed on-device. SDK performance and usage
metrics can be sent to Google. No model extraction or reverse engineering.

Nutrient data: USDA FoodData Central SR Legacy, official April 2018 CSV.
https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/download-datasets/
Selected records retain FDC IDs, English descriptions, and per-100g values.
Chinese labels and matching aliases were added for this application.
Data selection is limited and is not a complete Chinese recipe database.

Debug-only fixture: Nutrition5k example_plate.jpg, dataset authors / Google
Research, CC BY 4.0. Resized to 640 pixels. Attribution in licenses/.
https://github.com/google-research-datasets/Nutrition5k
The release APK does not include the test image or verification runner.

Gradle wrapper: Gradle, Apache 2.0. Java test dependency: JUnit 4.13.2, EPL 1.0.
Other Android transitive dependencies retain their respective licenses.
